go.toolchain_min    1.26.10
revision            0

description         htop-style TUI that shows what is really using your \
                    TCP/UDP ports

long_description    ${name} is a live terminal UI that lists listening and \
                    established TCP and UDP sockets along with the owning \
                    process, its CPU usage and a one-key way to open, \
                    inspect or end that process. Docker containers and \
                    Windows services are resolved as well.

